{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18400","headline":"赋得春风扇微和 · 邵偃","name":"赋得春风扇微和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"微风扇和气，韶景共芳晨。\n始见郊原绿，旋过御苑春。\n三条开广陌，八水泛通津。\n烟动花间叶，香流马上人。\n逶迤云彩曙，嘹唳鸟声频。\n爲报东堂客，明朝桂树新。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"邵偃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18400.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18400","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}